Troubleshooting Tips
Common Issues and Solutions
Issue: VMs not starting

Solution: Check resource availability with oc describe node and verify storage classes
Issue: Service not routing traffic

Solution: Verify labels match between VMs and service selectors using oc get vmis --show-labels
Issue: Load balancing not working

Solution: Ensure multiple VM instances are running and healthy with oc get vmis
Issue: Cannot access NodePort service

Solution: Check firewall rules and verify the node port is not blocked
Issue: DNS resolution failing

Solution: Verify CoreDNS is running with oc get pods -n openshift-dns
